      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If I understand, you are asking to be able to kick users from a group instance you made, even if you're not a mod? \n\nThat's literally made on purpose. You need to have a role with the kick permission to be able to do so.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
